call:send_channel_message{"channel": "random", "body": "Summary of websites posted to 'general' channel:

1. www.informations.com: Contains a job report showing unemployment edged down to 7.2%, described as a mix of relief and concern.

2. www.restaurant-zurich.com: About Zurich Restaurant, a cozy alpine-inspired eatery in the city center offering authentic Swiss cuisine. The restaurant features traditional dishes like cheese fondue, rösti, and chocolate fondue. It has warm wooden interiors with Swiss memorabilia, panoramic city views, and friendly staff in traditional attire."}
